{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/a7e712249ae82475e0467a93bd6f820c.webp?t=1726932383\" width=750 height=50 /></span> <br>From seed to sorcery \u2013 grow known and unique crops and discover their magical evolutions in this enchanting farming game. Cultivate different types of non-magical and magical plants on your farm, separated in the categories crops, trees, herbs and flowers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/75d3a14860234f2bf77331d495e2f9c5.avif?t=1726932383\" width=581 height=107 /></span> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/d7c88e7da8b38d5b00c5d97ca04c098b.webp?t=1726932383\" width=750 height=50 /></span> <br>Breed animals beyond imagination \u2013 master the art of magical crossbreeding with 27 species, including elusive dragons. Can you breed all species?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/327c9631a603a0a7402ed3a1ebd08a88.webp?t=1726932383\" width=750 height=50 /></span> <br>Embrace love's variety - discover the joy of dating characters with different backgrounds and mindsets. Help them with their personal goals and problems and learn about their own story.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/bb47d31758f311f843d59b65e3458fbc.avif?t=1726932383\" width=586 height=378 /></span>  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/514d8df51a55f8310a7299155449ce27.webp?t=1726932383\" width=512 height=50 /></span> <br>Rebuilding the world \u2013 restoring magic eases your farm life in a diverse world. The magic in the world has disappeared since a magical accident in the past. It's up to you to bring it back.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/0d5004390df1e8451698217fc6e6ae78.poster.avif?t=1726932383\" width=493 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/0d5004390df1e8451698217fc6e6ae78.webm?t=1726932383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/3ee6ab8e23fad27405e787edaf65e91c.webp?t=1726932383\" width=512 height=50 /></span> <br>Craft your own destiny - pursue various activities from cooking to fishing to brewing magic potions. Discover a wide variety of recipes and the wide range of fish with different colors. Can you catch them all?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/91a4e38fe503825be557988c452779f5.avif?t=1726932383\" width=500 height=100 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/e3f6ba7335f02f6e178b974f0d54caa6.webp?t=1726932383\" width=512 height=50 /></span> <br> Diverse avatars, boundless possibilities \u2013 play as one of the 5 species and customize your character based on their style: Humans, Ki'shen, Elves, Drakys and Nereids.<br> Design your dream farm - let the decoration system shape your farm's allure. Paint your decor while decorating your farm and farmhouse. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/d70793284623e6aa51dcc4c60cc22679.poster.avif?t=1726932383\" width=493 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/d70793284623e6aa51dcc4c60cc22679.webm?t=1726932383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/0159b9902a311be83975bf7dee64e062.webp?t=1726932383\" width=512 height=50 /></span> <br>Your new home is a farm near Dragonreath, which was known as a town full of magic and wonders. But a tragic catastrophe has changed everything.<br>Discover what happened in the past when a magical accident erased the magic from the world Hyldena. Due to the absence of magic, magical plants and creatures disappeared over time, leading to despair and starvation. The gods turned their backs on the living and vanished, while the people are trying in vain to adapt in this new world since then. <br>Maybe you can find a way to restore the magic and save everyone?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/6ecbee5478232771786ec8e05c12dbb1.webp?t=1726932383\" width=512 height=50 /></span> <br>Hyldena is home to 5 humanoid species: Humans, Elves, Drakys, Nereids and Ki'shen. Dragonreath is divided into 3 areas, each led by one of the factions - the <strong>Shailyn-Order</strong>, the <strong>Sidus-Alliance</strong> and the <strong>Obsideran-Pact</strong>, where each of them are trying to restore the magic in their own way - without success.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1906970?t=1726932383","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1726932383","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1726932383","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1726932383","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2157720,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>WISHLIST AND FOLLOW US!</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/794646d7e0b0666b6970bbbe553027ec.webp?t=1726932383\" width=50 height=50 /></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/52ad10f403c0de4772d3846aa5ba417e.poster.avif?t=1726932383\" width=240 height=34 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/52ad10f403c0de4772d3846aa5ba417e.webm?t=1726932383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/52ad10f403c0de4772d3846aa5ba417e.mp4?t=1726932383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/f93ce19584b819320186de8a071e1884.webp?t=1726932383\" width=50 height=50 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/a7e712249ae82475e0467a93bd6f820c.webp?t=1726932383\" width=750 height=50 /></span> <br>From seed to sorcery \u2013 grow known and unique crops and discover their magical evolutions in this enchanting farming game. Cultivate different types of non-magical and magical plants on your farm, separated in the categories crops, trees, herbs and flowers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/75d3a14860234f2bf77331d495e2f9c5.avif?t=1726932383\" width=581 height=107 /></span> <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/d7c88e7da8b38d5b00c5d97ca04c098b.webp?t=1726932383\" width=750 height=50 /></span> <br>Breed animals beyond imagination \u2013 master the art of magical crossbreeding with 27 species, including elusive dragons. Can you breed all species?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/327c9631a603a0a7402ed3a1ebd08a88.webp?t=1726932383\" width=750 height=50 /></span> <br>Embrace love's variety - discover the joy of dating characters with different backgrounds and mindsets. Help them with their personal goals and problems and learn about their own story.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/bb47d31758f311f843d59b65e3458fbc.avif?t=1726932383\" width=586 height=378 /></span>  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/514d8df51a55f8310a7299155449ce27.webp?t=1726932383\" width=512 height=50 /></span> <br>Rebuilding the world \u2013 restoring magic eases your farm life in a diverse world. The magic in the world has disappeared since a magical accident in the past. It's up to you to bring it back.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/0d5004390df1e8451698217fc6e6ae78.poster.avif?t=1726932383\" width=493 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/0d5004390df1e8451698217fc6e6ae78.webm?t=1726932383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/3ee6ab8e23fad27405e787edaf65e91c.webp?t=1726932383\" width=512 height=50 /></span> <br>Craft your own destiny - pursue various activities from cooking to fishing to brewing magic potions. Discover a wide variety of recipes and the wide range of fish with different colors. Can you catch them all?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/91a4e38fe503825be557988c452779f5.avif?t=1726932383\" width=500 height=100 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/e3f6ba7335f02f6e178b974f0d54caa6.webp?t=1726932383\" width=512 height=50 /></span> <br> Diverse avatars, boundless possibilities \u2013 play as one of the 5 species and customize your character based on their style: Humans, Ki'shen, Elves, Drakys and Nereids.<br> Design your dream farm - let the decoration system shape your farm's allure. Paint your decor while decorating your farm and farmhouse. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/d70793284623e6aa51dcc4c60cc22679.poster.avif?t=1726932383\" width=493 height=394 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/d70793284623e6aa51dcc4c60cc22679.webm?t=1726932383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/0159b9902a311be83975bf7dee64e062.webp?t=1726932383\" width=512 height=50 /></span> <br>Your new home is a farm near Dragonreath, which was known as a town full of magic and wonders. But a tragic catastrophe has changed everything.<br>Discover what happened in the past when a magical accident erased the magic from the world Hyldena. Due to the absence of magic, magical plants and creatures disappeared over time, leading to despair and starvation. The gods turned their backs on the living and vanished, while the people are trying in vain to adapt in this new world since then. <br>Maybe you can find a way to restore the magic and save everyone?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/extras/6ecbee5478232771786ec8e05c12dbb1.webp?t=1726932383\" width=512 height=50 /></span> <br>Hyldena is home to 5 humanoid species: Humans, Elves, Drakys, Nereids and Ki'shen. Dragonreath is divided into 3 areas, each led by one of the factions - the <strong>Shailyn-Order</strong>, the <strong>Sidus-Alliance</strong> and the <strong>Obsideran-Pact</strong>, where each of them are trying to restore the magic in their own way - without success.","developers":["MoonFlameGames"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1906970/header.jpg?t=1726932383","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1906970/688008/d0a1f575fe87f2b56fdc791b3bac9fdab2350e3c/1751046288/dash_av1.mpd?t=1713432414","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.c