nd magic potions brewing, and restore the magic in a damaged fantasy world.","steam_appid":1906970,"support_info":{"email":"magicalharvest.game@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, German","type":"game","website":"https://moonflamegames.games/"}